\subtree{
  \title{Decision}
  \p{CI rejects any file under \code{Theory/} importing \code{Mathlib.CategoryTheory.*}, \code{Mathlib.AlgebraicTopology.*}, \code{Kernel.*}, or \code{Root.*}. Anything needed is copied or ported into \code{Interface/} through the seal mechanism (→ \ref{dec-rt-0013}). Mathlib \em{tactics} (\code{Mathlib.Tactic.*}, \code{Aesop}, \code{omega}, \code{decide}, \code{positivity}, etc.) are allowed everywhere.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rationale}
  \p{Tactics are not definitions; they cannot leak defeq about our objects except through unfolding, which the linter forbids independently.}
}
